Spec: Explicit development Broker host

Purpose:
  Host a pending-registration pipe for locally launched integration experiments.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Broker.Console.csproj
  ./Program.cs

Must:
  Require explicit private state directory and test pipe suffix; print only readiness and accept standard-input stop.
  Stop after parent input closes or a bounded development lifetime and never install services.
  Enable pending-grant requests only with the explicit `--pending-grants` argument.
